	["{area:442} flight master"] = "{area:442}飞行管理员",
	["{area:450} lies on the coast south of {npc:10323}'s beach. Protect the prospector while he searches for the fossil.\nCareful: Ambushers appear as he passes certain spots: a scout comes out from under the board ramp, and more scouts come out when he checks the tent."] = "{area:450}位于{npc:10323}海滩以南的海岸上。在勘探者寻找化石时保护他。\n注意：他经过某些地点时会出现伏击者：经过木板坡道下方时会钻出一名斥候，他检查帐篷时还会钻出更多斥候。",
	["{area:452}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:452}：遇到就杀",
	["{item:12191}; underwater"] = "{item:12191}：在水下",
