	["{npc:1078}: the bigger raptors in the valley west of the dig are for your next {zone:1437} visit, at about 27"] = "{npc:1078}：挖掘场西边山谷里的较大迅猛龙，留到下次来{zone:1437}时击杀，约27级",
	["{npc:11218} sleeps at the {area:448} in southern {zone:1439}. Use the {item:13536} to wake him and lead him south along the road into {area:331} to {npc:11219} at {area:413}; blow the horn again whenever he falls asleep.\nCareful: Scripted ambushes of three mobs each attack along the road: furbolgs on the {zone:1439} stretch and undead nearer {area:413}."] = "{npc:11218}睡在{zone:1439}南部的{area:448}。用{item:13536}唤醒他，沿路向南把他带进{area:331}，到{area:413}的{npc:11219}那里；他每次睡着时就再吹一次号角。\n注意：路上会有三只怪一组的脚本伏击：{zone:1439}那段是熊怪，靠近{area:413}时是亡灵。",
	["{npc:11406} and {npc:258785} are in the {object:32386}, in the {object:32362}."] = "{npc:11406}和{npc:258785}在{object:32362}的{object:32386}。",
