	["{object:19868} lies all over the flats. Scorpid Reavers roam the north half; keep to it, away from the Saltstone Basilisks, Crystalhides and Gazers (32-35) of the middle and the far south."] = "{object:19868}遍布平地。毒蝎掠夺者在北半部游荡；留在这一带，远离中部和远南方的盐石蜥蜴、水晶皮和凝视者（32-35级）。",
	["{quest:1738}: in {zone:1440}, on the way to {zone:1443}"] = "{quest:1738}：在{zone:1440}，前往{zone:1443}的路上",
