	["Jungle Stalkers"] = "丛林捕猎者",
	["Leave town by the tunnel and follow the coast north; the letter lies in the Bloodsail camp on the beach, where \"Pretty Boy\" Duncan walks."] = "从隧道出城，沿海岸向北；信在沙滩上的血帆营地里，帅小伙子邓肯在那里走动。",
	["Level 42.06"] = "42.06级",
