G["forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge"] = {
	["Back at the {area:247}: Dorius stands by the road. Escort him north-east to {area:1959} and keep him alive; when it is over, read the {object:175704} he leaves on the road."] = "回到{area:247}：多里乌斯站在路边。护送他向东北到{area:1959}并保住他的命；结束后阅读他留在路上的{object:175704}。",
	["Below ground"] = "在地下",
	["Carry the {object:149047} south along the rim of the Cauldron and light the four Sentry Braziers, from the south-west round to the south-east."] = "带着{object:149047}沿大熔炉边缘向南走，从西南绕到东南，点燃四个哨兵火盆。",
	["Class trainer"] = "职业训练师",
	["Dark Iron Geologist"] = "黑铁地质学家",
	["Dark Iron Slaver"] = "黑铁奴隶贩子",
	["Dark Iron Taskmaster"] = "黑铁监工",
	["Fly to {area:1537}"] = "飞往{area:1537}",
	["For {npc:8256} in {area:1537}, later"] = "给{area:1537}的{npc:8256}，稍后",
	["For {npc:8256} in {zone:1455}, at the end of this guide"] = "在本指南结尾交给{zone:1455}的{npc:8256}",
	["Four rune rubbings in {zone:1447}: keep it"] = "{zone:1447}的四份符文拓印：留着它",
	["From {area:144} ride south into the {zone:1418}, then west past the Horde town of {area:340} (give it room) and up the trail into {area:51}. {area:1446} is the scaffolded camp on the north-west rim."] = "从{area:144}向南骑进{zone:1418}，然后向西经过部落城镇{area:340}（绕开它），再沿小路向上进入{area:51}。{area:1446}是西北边缘搭着脚手架的营地。",
	["From {area:144} ride south into the {zone:1418}, then west past the Horde town of {area:340} (give it room) and up the trail into {area:51}: the {area:247} is just inside, in the south-east. The prisoner in the wooden outhouse wants 15 {item:4306} and eight dead Dark Iron Geologists from the dig site around it. The outhouse also opens with the key, if you found one."] = "从{area:144}向南骑进{zone:1418}，再向西绕过部落的{area:340}城镇（离它远点），沿小径上行进入{area:51}：{area:247}一进去就是，在东南边。木制茅房里的囚犯要15个{item:4306}，以及其周围挖掘场里的八名黑铁地质学家。如果你找到了钥匙，茅房也可以用钥匙打开。",
	["From {area:144} ride south into the {zone:1418}, then west past the Horde town of {area:340} (give it room) and up the trail into {zone:1427}: the {area:247} is just inside, in the south-east. The prisoner in the wooden outhouse wants 15 {item:4306} and eight dead Dark Iron Geologists from the dig site around it. The outhouse also opens with the key, if you found one."] = "从{area:144}向南骑行进入{zone:1418}，再向西经过部落城镇{area:340}（绕远些），沿小径上行进入{zone:1427}：刚进去的东南边就是{area:247}。木制厕所里的囚犯要15块{item:4306}，并要求击杀周围挖掘场的八名黑铁地质学家。如果找到钥匙，也可以用钥匙打开厕所。",
	["Golems and elementals"] = "傀儡和元素",
	["Greater Lava Spider"] = "巨型熔岩蜘蛛",
	["Greater Lava Spiders"] = "{npc:5858}",
	["Heavy War Golem"] = "重型战争傀儡",
	["Heavy War Golems patrol the floor of the Cauldron below Kalaran; Magma Elementals drift among them. Golems and elementals drop the oil, elementals the hearts.\nTaskmasters and Slavers drive the slaves all over the Cauldron, and any of them can carry a {item:10551}. The Steamsmiths work at the furnaces in the middle (the {item:18959}), the Lookouts stand on the southern ridges (the Spyglass). Any {object:147516} may drop the {item:11818}: keep it.\nCareful: Dark Iron Slavers (level 45-46) call for help from allies within 15 yd when pulled, cast Net from up to 15 yd, and use Rend in melee."] = "重型战争傀儡在卡拉兰下方的火山口地面上巡逻；岩浆元素在它们之间游荡。傀儡和元素掉落油，元素掉落心脏。\n监工和奴隶贩子驱赶着奴隶遍布火山口，他们中的任何一个都可能携带{item:10551}。蒸汽铁匠在中央的熔炉干活（{item:18959}），瞭望员站在南边的山脊上（望远镜）。任何{object:147516}都可能掉落{item:11818}：留着。\n注意：黑铁奴隶贩子（45-46级）被拉时向15码内的盟友求援，还会从最多15码外撒网，并在近战中使用撕裂。",
	["If you skipped The {item:3985} or Facing Negolash, grind here to level 48.27 to stay on the route's plan."] = "如果你跳过了{item:3985}或“直面内戈拉什”任务，就在这里刷到48.27级，以保持攻略的节奏。",
	["If you skipped The {item:3985} or Facing Negolash, grind here to level 48.27 to stay on the route's plan. Or, with a group, run the {area:2100} dungeon or the {area:978} dungeon instead."] = "如果跳过了{item:3985}或《挑战奈古拉什》，在这里刷怪补到48.27级，以跟上路线进度。也可以组队刷{area:2100}或{area:978}地下城。",
	["If you skipped {quest:3452}, grind here to level 48.98 to stay on the route's plan."] = "如果你跳过了{quest:3452}，就在这里刷到48.98级，以保持攻略的节奏。",
	["If you skipped {quest:3452}, grind here to level 48.98 to stay on the route's plan. Or, with a group, run the {area:2100} dungeon or the {area:978} dungeon instead."] = "如果跳过了{quest:3452}，在这里刷怪补到48.98级，以跟上路线进度。也可以组队刷{area:2100}或{area:978}地下城。",
	["If you skipped {quest:7701}, grind here to level 48.66 to stay on the route's plan."] = "如果你跳过了{quest:7701}，就在这里刷到48.66级，以保持攻略的节奏。",
	["If you skipped {quest:7701}, grind here to level 48.66 to stay on the route's plan. Or, with a group, run the {area:2100} dungeon or the {area:978} dungeon instead."] = "如果跳过了{quest:7701}，在这里刷怪补到48.66级，以跟上路线进度。也可以组队刷{area:2100}或{area:978}地下城。",
	["Incendosaur"] = "炎蜥",
	["Into {area:51}"] = "进入{area:51}",
	["Into {zone:1427}"] = "进入{zone:1427}",
	["Kalaran Windblade"] = "卡拉兰·风刃",
	["Kalaran stands on the rim of the Cauldron, south of {area:1446}. Listen to his story."] = "卡拉然·温布雷站在{area:1446}南边的大熔炉边缘。听他讲述他的故事。",
	["Level 48.27"] = "等级 48.27",
	["Level 48.66"] = "等级 48.66",
	["Level 48.98"] = "等级 48.98",
	["Listen to {npc:8479}'s story once more."] = "再听一次{npc:8479}讲述他的故事。",
	["On the way"] = "途中",
	["Ride east across the Cauldron to the {area:247} in the south-east. The prisoner in the wooden outhouse wants 15 {item:4306} and eight dead Dark Iron Geologists from the dig site around it. The outhouse also opens with the key, if you found one.\nThe dwarf stands by the road at the dig site. When it is over, read the {object:175704} he leaves on the road in {area:1959}."] = "向东骑过火山口，前往东南的{area:247}。木制茅房里的囚犯要15个{item:4306}，以及其周围挖掘场里的八名黑铁地质学家。如果你找到了钥匙，茅房也可以用钥匙打开。\n那名矮人站在挖掘场路边。结束后，阅读他留在{area:1959}路上的{object:175704}。",
	["Ride north-west across the Cauldron to {area:1446}, the scaffolded camp on the north-west rim."] = "向西北骑过火山口到{area:1446}，那是西北边缘搭着脚手架的营地。",
	["Sentry Braziers"] = "哨兵火盆",
	["The Grimesilt outhouse"] = "格里塞特厕所",
	["The night elf stands alone west of {area:1446}. Hear his story."] = "那个暗夜精灵独自站在{area:1446}西边。听他讲述他的故事。",
	["The prisoner's next task, Ledger from {zone:1446}, sends you to the {zone:1435} and {zone:1445}: skip it."] = "囚犯的下一个任务“{zone:1446}的账本”会让你去{zone:1435}和{zone:1445}：跳过。",
	["The spiders roam the plateaus and lava pools in the south-west of the gorge.\nHeavy War Golems patrol the floor of the Cauldron below Kalaran; Magma Elementals drift among them. Golems and elementals drop the oil, elementals the hearts.\nTaskmasters and Slavers drive the slaves all over the Cauldron, and any of them can carry a {item:10551}. The Steamsmiths work at the furnaces in the middle (the {item:18959}), the Lookouts stand on the southern ridges (the Spyglass). Any {object:147516} may drop the {item:11818}: keep it.\nCareful: Dark Iron Slavers (level 45-46) call for help from allies within 15 yd when pulled, cast Net from up to 15 yd, and use Rend in melee."] = "蜘蛛在峡谷西南的高地和熔岩池出没。\n重型战争傀儡在卡拉兰下方的火山口地面上巡逻；岩浆元素在它们之间游荡。傀儡和元素掉落油，元素掉落心脏。\n监工和奴隶贩子驱赶着奴隶遍布火山口，他们中的任何一个都可能携带{item:10551}。蒸汽铁匠在中央的熔炉干活（{item:18959}），瞭望员站在南边的山脊上（望远镜）。任何{object:147516}都可能掉落{item:11818}：留着。\n注意：黑铁奴隶贩子（45-46级）被拉时向15码内的盟友求援，还会从最多15码外撒网，并在近战中使用撕裂。",
	["The spiders roam the plateaus and lava pools south of {npc:8436}, on the way to Kalaran."] = "蜘蛛在{npc:8436}以南的高地和熔岩池出没，就在去卡拉兰的路上。",
	["The {object:149502} it gives holds a {item:10575}: keep it for {npc:9459} in the {zone:1428}"] = "它给出的{object:149502}里有一件{item:10575}：留着交给{zone:1428}的{npc:9459}",
	["The {object:179827} board"] = "{object:179827}布告板",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:14621} is a level 50 elite: most classes solo it at level 52, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英敌人，建议寻找其他玩家组队完成。{npc:14621}是 50 级精英，多数职业到 52 级可以尝试单独击败，但可能仍需帮助。独自一人时可跳过，路线会安排刷怪补回经验。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:5860} (level 50 elite) needs a group of 3. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英敌人，建议寻找其他玩家组队完成。{npc:5860}（50 级精英）需要 3 人小队。独自一人时可跳过，路线会安排刷怪补回经验。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {quest:3181} needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英敌人，建议寻找其他玩家组队完成。{quest:3181}需要 2 人小队。独自一人时可跳过，路线会安排刷怪补回经验。",
	["To {area:2101}"] = "前往{area:2101}",
	["Velarok Windblade"] = "维拉罗克·风刃",
	["Xiggs waits in the {object:32359}."] = "希克斯在{object:32359}等候。",
	["Zamael Lunthistle"] = "扎玛尔·伦西斯尔",
	["grind on {npc:5839}"] = "反复击杀{npc:5839}补足经验",
	["grind on {npc:5844}"] = "反复击杀{npc:5844}补足经验",
	["grind on {npc:9318}"] = "反复击杀{npc:9318}补足经验",
	["{area:1442}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:1442}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:1443} opens in the north of the Cauldron. The Secret Plans lie on its upper ledge; Incendosaurs swim in the lava pools further in, so pull them to the edge. Stay clear of {npc:14621} and his elite guards deep inside."] = "{area:1443}的入口在大熔炉北部。秘密设计图在上层岩架上；{npc:9318}在更深处的熔岩池里游动，把它们拉到池边。远离深处的{npc:14621}和他的精英卫兵。",
	["{area:1446} flight master"] = "{area:1446}的飞行管理员",
	["{area:51}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:51}：遇到就杀",
	["{item:10551} on the way"] = "{item:10551}，途中",
	["{item:18922}; below ground"] = "{item:18922}：在地下",
	["{npc:5844} along the way to {area:1446}"] = "前往{area:1446}途中的{npc:5844}",
	["{npc:5846} along the way to {area:1446}"] = "前往{area:1446}途中的{npc:5846}",
	["{npc:5858} on the way"] = "{npc:5858}，途中",
	["{npc:8509} and the dragonflight's hoard are beside {npc:8479}, on the rim south of {area:1446}."] = "{npc:8509}和黑龙军团的宝藏就在{npc:8479}旁边，位于{area:1446}南边的边缘上。",
	["{npc:9318} along the way to {area:1446}"] = "前往{area:1446}途中的{npc:9318}",
	["{npc:9318} on the way"] = "{npc:9318}，途中",
	["{npc:9616}: the oozes are in {zone:1448}, keep it"] = "{npc:9616}：软泥怪在{zone:1448}，留着它",
	["{object:147516} dwarves"] = "{object:147516}矮人",
	["{quest:3453} lies on the ground at {npc:8479}'s feet; {quest:3462} stands beside him."] = "{quest:3453}就放在{npc:8479}脚边的地上；{quest:3462}站在他身旁。",
	["{quest:3462}: hand it in on the way back to {area:1446}"] = "{quest:3462}：在返回{area:1446}的路上交付",
	["{zone:1427}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{zone:1427}：沿途击杀以下目标",
}

G["forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater"] = {
	["Archesonus stands beside King Magni in the {object:171709}."] = "阿克瑟努斯站在{object:171709}中麦格尼国王旁边。",
	["Below ground"] = "在地下",
	["Bind and train"] = "设置炉石并训练",
	["Bones and equipment"] = "骨头和设备",
	["Class trainer"] = "职业训练师",
	["Dinosaur Bones lie on the ground in the south-west, among the stegodons: those are elite, pick the bones up around them and take the rest from Diemetradons. The expedition's {item:11112} lies in the south-west jungle."] = "恐龙骨头散落在西南部的地面上，在剑龙之间：剑龙是精英，在它们周围捡骨头，其余的从双帆龙身上获取。探险队的{item:11112}在西南部丛林中。",
	["Eastern Pylon"] = "东部水晶塔",
	["Ends with {npc:9298} in {zone:1452}: keep it"] = "在{zone:1452}的{npc:9298}处结束：留着",
	["Fly to {area:150}"] = "飞往{area:150}",
	["Fly to {area:1537}"] = "飞往{area:1537}",
	["Fly to {area:415}"] = "飞往{area:415}",
	["Fly to {area:976}"] = "飞往{area:976}",
	["For {npc:7775} in {zone:1444}: keep it"] = "交给{zone:1444}的{npc:7775}：留着",
	["Four rune rubbings in {zone:1447}: keep it"] = "{zone:1447}的四个符文拓片：留着",
	["Lar'korwi Mates and the raft"] = "{npc:9683}和木筏",
	["Level 49.51"] = "等级 49.51",
	["Level 50.4"] = "等级 50.4",
	["Northern Pylon"] = "北部水晶塔",
	["Pterrordax"] = "翼手龙",
	["Ride east to {area:1943}, where the robot stands among the gorillas. Stay out of the deep cave there."] = "向东骑行到{area:1943}，机器人站在猩猩中间。别进那里的深洞。",
	["Ride north along the western jungle back to the refuge."] = "沿西部丛林向北骑回避难所。",
	["Ride north to {area:1943}, where the robot stands among the gorillas. Stay out of the deep cave there."] = "向北骑行到{area:1943}，机器人站在猩猩中间。别进那里的深洞。",
	["Ride south down the east side. Young Diemetradons graze the eastern jungle and {npc:9165} fly near the eastern cliffs; both drop {npc:9998}'s scales."] = "沿东侧向南骑行。幼双帆龙在东部丛林吃草，{npc:9165}在东部悬崖附近飞行；两者都掉落{npc:9998}要的鳞片。",
	["Ride south down the east side. Young Diemetradons graze the eastern jungle and {npc:9165} fly near the eastern cliffs; both drop {npc:9998}'s scales. The crate sits at the abandoned camp in the eastern jungle."] = "沿东侧向南骑行，幼双帆龙在东侧丛林活动，{npc:9165}在东侧峭壁附近飞行，两者都会掉落{npc:9998}所需的鳞片。箱子位于东侧丛林的废弃营地内。",
	["Ride south to {area:537} in the middle of the crater, then east into the eastern jungle. Crystal clusters stand all over the crater, many of them around {area:537}: take a few extra of each colour. Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers drop the petals; the expedition's {item:11113} sits at an abandoned camp in the eastern jungle."] = "向南骑到陨石坑中央的{area:537}，然后向东进入东部丛林。水晶簇遍布陨石坑，许多在{area:537}周围：每种颜色多拿几个。{npc:6509}和血瓣花猛击者掉落花瓣；远征队的{item:11113}在东部丛林的一处废弃营地里。",
	["Ride south-west past {npc:9619}: the silithid hive fills the south of the crater. Use the Scraping Vial on a hatchery, a chamber with hanging larvae. Gorishi wasps and workers drop {quest:3764}; Pterrordax nest on the southern cliffs if you still need kills.\nCareful: Gorishi silithids are level 51-54 and cast {spell:8137} or {spell:14120} in melee; Gorishi Workers have a 50% chance to call for help within 25 yd once they fall below 45% health."] = "骑行向西南，经过 {npc:9619}：异种虫巢遍布环形山南部。对孵化室使用未使用的采集瓶，孵化室就是悬挂着幼虫的洞室。格里什黄蜂和格里什工蝎会掉落 {quest:3764}；若击杀数量还不够，南侧悬崖上也有翼手龙栖息。\n小心：格里什异种虫为 51-54 级，近战时会施放 {spell:8137} 或 {spell:14120}；格里什工蝎的生命值降至 45% 以下时，有 50% 的概率呼叫 25 码内的同伴前来援助。",
	["Ride west back to the refuge.\nGive the elite devilsaurs and stegodons a wide berth. Pick up every Power Crystal and {object:157936} you pass from here on."] = "向西骑行返回营地。\n远离精英魔暴龙和剑龙，从这里开始，沿途遇到的能量水晶和{object:157936}都要拾取。",
	["Ride west from {npc:9619}: the silithid hive fills the south of the crater. Use the Scraping Vial on a hatchery, a chamber with hanging larvae. Gorishi wasps and workers drop {quest:3764}; Pterrordax nest on the southern cliffs if you still need kills.\nCareful: Gorishi silithids are level 51-54 and cast {spell:8137} or {spell:14120} in melee; Gorishi Workers have a 50% chance to call for help within 25 yd once they fall below 45% health."] = "从{npc:9619}向西骑：异种虫巢穴布满火山口南部。在一处孵化室（挂着幼虫的房间）使用刮取小瓶。格里什黄蜂和工虫掉落{quest:3764}；如果还需要击杀数，翼手龙在南边的悬崖筑巢。\n小心：格里什异种虫为51-54级，近战时施放{spell:8137}或{spell:14120}；格里什工虫血量降到45%以下时，有50%几率在25码内呼救。",
	["Ride west out of {area:976} to the long ramp down into {area:490}. {npc:9619} camps at the foot of the ramp, in the south-east corner of the crater."] = "从{area:976}向西骑，沿长坡下到{area:490}。{npc:9619}在坡底扎营，位于火山口的东南角。",
	["Ride west out of {area:976} to the long ramp down into {zone:1449}. {npc:9619} camps at the foot of the ramp, in the south-east corner of the crater."] = "向西骑出{area:976}，到达通往{zone:1449}的长坡道。{npc:9619}在坡道脚下扎营，位于环形山的东南角。",
	["The Gorishi hive"] = "格里什虫巢",
	["The Lar'korwi Mates prowl the jungle west of {npc:9619}. The wrecked raft lies on the shore of the lake there; the small pack sits in the water beside it. Keep the compass, map and key for {npc:8737}. Any beast in the crater may drop {item:11116}: right-click it."] = "拉克维的配偶在{npc:9619}西边的丛林中徘徊。失事的木筏在那里的湖岸上；小背包在它旁边的水里。指南针、地图和钥匙留给{npc:8737}。环形山中任何野兽都可能掉落{item:11116}：右键点击它。",
	["The dead Threshadon lies by the water north of {npc:9619}."] = "死去的蛇颈龙躺在{npc:9619}北边的水边。",
	["The flight from Theramore lands in {area:976}."] = "从塞拉摩起飞的航班降落在{area:976}。",
	["The gorillas on {area:1943} carry the pelts: keep it for the second Un'Goro visit, around 56"] = "{area:1943}的猩猩身上有毛皮：留到第二次来安戈洛时再做，大约56级",
	["The pylon stands on the eastern cliffs."] = "水晶塔立在东部悬崖上。",
	["The pylon stands on the slope east of the refuge. Pterrordax circle the slopes around it: they count for Spraggle and drop {npc:9998}'s scales."] = "水晶塔位于营地东侧山坡，翼手龙在周围山坡盘旋，既计入斯普拉格·弗劳克的任务，也会掉落{npc:9998}所需的鳞片。",
	["The pylon stands on the western cliffs. {npc:9167} fly over the whole west side."] = "水晶塔立在西部悬崖上。{npc:9167}在整个西侧上空飞行。",
	["The relics are in the {zone:1428}: keep it"] = "圣物在{zone:1428}：留着",
	["The {zone:1455} quests were taken at the end of the {zone:1427} guide: fly straight on to {zone:1440} for {zone:1447}."] = "{zone:1455}的任务已在{zone:1427}指南末尾接取：直接飞往{zone:1440}，前往{zone:1447}。",
	["Theramore flight master"] = "塞拉摩飞行管理员",
	["To {area:2101}"] = "前往{area:2101}",
	["Top up here to level 49.51 before the hand-ins at {area:541}: they take you to level 50."] = "在{area:541}交任务前，先在这里刷到49.51级：交完后能到50级。",
	["Top up here to level 49.51 before the hand-ins at {area:541}: they take you to level 50. Or, with a group, run the {area:2100} dungeon instead."] = "在这里补到49.51级，再去{area:541}交任务，交完会升到50级。也可以组队去{area:2100}副本。",
	["Top up here to level 50.4 before the hand-ins at {area:3137}: they take you to level 51."] = "在{area:3137}交任务前，先在这里刷到50.4级：交完后能到51级。",
	["Top up here to level 50.4 before the hand-ins at {area:3137}: they take you to level 51. Or, with a group, run the {area:2100} dungeon or the {area:1417} dungeon instead."] = "在这里补到50.4级，再去{area:3137}交任务，交完会升到51级。也可以组队去{area:2100}副本或{area:1417}副本。",
	["Western Pylon"] = "西部水晶塔",
