	["Mages: {npc:198}, the mage trainer, stands upstairs in the Abbey: take the stairs inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "法师：法师训练师{npc:198}在修道院楼上：从里面的楼梯上去，箭头无法区分楼层。",
	["Murloc"] = "鱼人",
	["Murloc Streamrunner"] = "鱼人溪流行者",
	["Murlocs and Murloc Streamrunners hold the east shore; the Junk Piles lie in their camp."] = "鱼人和溪流鱼人占据着东岸；垃圾堆就在它们的营地里。",
	["Murlocs and Murloc Streamrunners hold the east shore; the Junk Piles lie in their camp. Careful: the murlocs stand close together, so a fight easily pulls two or three at once: pull them one at a time from the edge of the camp, and don't chase one into the next group."] = "鱼人和鱼人激流者占据着东岸；垃圾堆就在它们的营地里。小心：鱼人站得很近，一场战斗很容易同时引来两三只：从营地边缘一只一只地拉，不要追着一只跑进下一群。",
	["North-east of the logging camp. Defias Rogue Wizards camp on the shores of the lake."] = "在伐木场东北方。{npc:474}在湖岸边扎营。",
	["Painted Gnoll Armbands"] = "{item:782}",
	["Prowler"] = "徘徊者",
	["Red Burlap Bandanas"] = "{item:752}",
	["Red Linen Bandanas"] = "{item:1019}",
