	["{npc:10118} stands on the Rut'theran dock where you land. Then take the portal up to {npc:4217} in the {area:1658}."] = "落地后，{npc:10118}就在鲁瑟兰村码头上。随后通过传送门上去，到{area:1658}找{npc:4217}。",
