	["Fillion's camp is north-west of it, and the Shriekling Matriarchs nest just west of the camp."] = "菲里昂·炎风的营地在它西北侧，尖啸幼兽主母就在营地西侧筑巢。",
	["Find {npc:258130}"] = "找到{npc:258130}",
