	["Head north-west to the hippogryph nests on the western cliffs. {item:263493} lies around the nests; the Matriarch patrols among them.\nThe Novice Seers practise in the clearing west of Shen'dar."] = "向西北前往西部悬崖上的角鹰兽巢穴。{item:263493}散落在巢穴周围；女族长在巢间巡逻。\n见习先知在杉达尔以西的空地上练习。",
	["Heal the injured druids in the Nightfang Den"] = "治疗夜牙巢穴内受伤的德鲁伊",
	["Highlands Bandit"] = "高地强盗",
