	["Crawler Legs: the Tide Crawlers"] = "潮行蟹腿：潮行蟹",
	["Take the antidote from {npc:8583} at the foot of {area:256} only now, on the way down: it lasts five minutes. {npc:8584} waits north-west, by the cave: go straight on to him."] = "只在现在、下山途中到{area:256}脚下从{npc:8583}处拿解毒剂：药效持续五分钟。{npc:8584}在西北方洞穴旁等候：直接继续朝他走。",
	["{area:262}'s entrance"] = "{area:262}的入口",
	["{npc:3666}, upstairs in the inn: take the stairs inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart"] = "{npc:3666}在旅店楼上：从里面的楼梯上去，箭头无法区分楼层。",
