	["{quest:7806}: 50 reputation for 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. After the four first donations a Human, Night Elf or Gnome stands at Friendly 700 of 6,000, so Honored is 5,300 away: 106 turn-ins, 2,120 {item:14047} (Dwarves start 900 higher: 88 turn-ins; Skyborne start at Neutral 2,000, so 6,400 away: 128, two fewer after Exploring the Alliance). The level 52-59 quests above take 12 turn-ins off; each {zone:1426} hub you did takes 10 to 26 more off. More hubs pay {faction:47}, in full while they are no more than 5 levels below you: {area:144} in {zone:1432} (about 3,500 in all) and {area:150} in the {zone:1437} (about 2,500). From level 51 {zone:1459}'s one-time quests add about 1,900. Every city gain also gives a quarter as much to the other three Alliance cities (not counted here). Hand in all your {item:14047} at once."] = "{quest:7806}：每20个{item:14047}换50点声望，想交多少次都行。四次首次捐赠之后，人类、暗夜精灵或侏儒处在友善700/6,000，离尊敬还差5,300点：106次上交、2,120个{item:14047}（矮人初始高900点：88次；天裔从中立2,000开始，差6,400点：128次，做了“探索联盟”后少两次）。上面52-59级的任务能减掉12次上交；你做过的每个{zone:1426}任务点还能再减10到26次。更多任务点会给{faction:47}，只要最多低于你5级就按全额：{zone:1432}的{area:144}（共约3,500点）和{zone:1437}的{area:150}（约2,500点）。从51级起，{zone:1459}的一次性任务再加约1,900点。每份主城声望收益还会以四分之一的比例给其他三个联盟主城（这里未计入）。把所有{item:14047}一次交清。",
