G["forever/reputation/stormwind"] = {
	["About 4,500 {faction:72} reputation from low-level quests in Elwynn and the {area:717}"] = "在艾尔文森林和{area:717}做低等级任务可获得约4,500点{faction:72}声望",
	["Optional: eastern Elwynn, around {npc:261} on the bridge and the {area:91}, about 1,000 reputation in 40 minutes at 60. Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可选：艾尔文森林东部，桥上的{npc:261}和{area:91}附近，60级时约40分钟可得1,000点声望。无限中这些旧任务在任何等级都按全额发放。跳过这一步即跳过该据点。",
	["Optional: four quick deliveries inside {faction:72} for 200 reputation in about five minutes. Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可选：在{faction:72}城内送四次快件，约五分钟可得200点声望。无限中这些旧任务在任何等级都按全额发放。跳过这一步即跳过该据点。",
	["Optional: the Human start valley north of {area:87}: about 1,600 reputation in 40 minutes at 60, the best rate of the hubs. {npc:823} and {npc:197} stand at {area:24}. Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可选：{area:87}以北的人类新手山谷：60级时约40分钟得1,600点声望，是各据点中效率最高的。{npc:823}和{npc:197}站在{area:24}。无限中这些旧任务在任何等级都按全额发放。跳过这一步即跳过该据点。",
	["Optional: the {area:717} is {faction:72}'s prison, a dungeon in the canals of the {object:2101}. At 60 you clear it alone in ten minutes: 300 reputation. {npc:1719} stands at the gate, {npc:1721} in {object:2100}. Two more {area:717} quests start outside the city, 100 each, if you pass by: What Comes Around... ({npc:1696}) from {npc:859} in {area:69} and Crime and Punishment ({npc:1663}) from {npc:270} in {area:42}. (The Stockade Riots, 100 more, needs the Unsent Letter from {npc:639} in the {area:1581} first.) Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可选：{area:717}是{faction:72}的监狱，位于{object:2101}运河中的地下城。60级时十分钟即可单刷：300点声望。{npc:1719}站在门口，{npc:1721}在{object:2100}。还有两个{area:717}任务在城市外接取，各100点，若顺路可做：因果报应……（{npc:1696}）来自{area:69}的{npc:859}，罪与罚（{npc:1663}）来自{area:42}的{npc:270}。（监狱暴动，另100点，需先拿到{area:1581}里{npc:639}的未寄出的信。）无限中这些旧任务在任何等级都按全额发放。跳过这一步即跳过该据点。",
	["Optional: {area:87}, Westbrook and the farms south of {area:87}: about 1,450 reputation in an hour at 60. {npc:240}, {npc:241} and {npc:253} stand around the Lion's Pride Inn. Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可选：{area:87}、西泉和{area:87}以南的农场：60级时约一小时得1,450点声望。{npc:240}、{npc:241}和{npc:253}站在狮王之傲旅店附近。无限中这些旧任务在任何等级都按全额发放。跳过这一步即跳过该据点。",
	["These quests are level 52 to 58, so they pay in full at 60. {npc:10838} and {npc:11053} at {area:3197}, in the south of the {zone:1422}, send you against the four Scourge cauldrons: 820 {faction:72} reputation in all and 600 {object:92525} on the side. The Skeletal Flayers and Slavering Ghouls roam the fields north of the camp."] = "这些任务为52到58级，所以60级时按全额发放。{zone:1422}南部{area:3197}的{npc:10838}和{npc:11053}会派你去对付四口天灾大锅：共820点{faction:72}声望，另有600个{object:92525}。骷髅剥皮者和流涎食尸鬼在营地以北的田野游荡。",
	["{npc:9562} at {area:2418}, in the south-east of the {zone:1428}, starts {quest:4183}: a chain to {area:69} and {object:2117}, 175 {faction:72} and 175 {zone:1457} reputation (level 54). The Black Broodlings and the {npc:7044} live on the slopes north of the Vigil; the {npc:7040} and {npc:7041} west of it, in the middle of the zone."] = "{zone:1428}东南{area:2418}的{npc:9562}会开启{quest:4183}：一条通往{area:69}和{object:2117}的任务链，175点{faction:72}和175点{zone:1457}声望（54级）。黑色雏龙和{npc:7044}住在守夜营地以北的山坡；{npc:7040}和{npc:7041}在其以西、区域中部。",
	["{quest:7796}: 50 reputation for 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. After the four first donations a non-Human stands at Friendly 700 of 6,000, so Honored is 5,300 away: 106 turn-ins, 2,120 {item:14047} (Humans start 900 higher: 88 turn-ins; a Skyborne's Exploring the Alliance paid 100, two fewer). The level 52-58 quests above take 23 turn-ins off; every Elwynn hub you did takes 20 to 30 more off. More quest hubs pay {faction:72}, in full while they are no more than 5 levels below you: {zone:1436} (about 2,500 in all), Redridge's {area:69} (about 3,000) and {zone:1431}'s {area:42} (about 2,900). Every city gain also gives a quarter as much to the other three Alliance cities (not counted here). Hand in all your {item:14047} at once."] = "{quest:7796}：每20个{item:14047}换50点声望，次数不限。四次首次捐献之后，非人类角色处于友善700/6,000，所以距尊敬还差5,300点：106次上交，2,120个{item:14047}（人类起始高900点：88次上交；一位天裔的“探索联盟”给了100点，少两次）。上面的52-58级任务可抵掉23次；你每做一个艾尔文森林据点，还能再抵20到30次。还有更多据点给{faction:72}声望，在你高于其不超过5级时全额：{zone:1436}（共约2,500）、赤脊山的{area:69}（约3,000）和{zone:1431}的{area:42}（约2,900）。每次城市声望收益还会给另外三座联盟城市四分之一的量（此处未计入）。把所有{item:14047}一次性上交。",
}
